"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":39.16,"default_fair_val":39.16,"premium_pct":44.5,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":15.9,"pe_forward":14,"pb_trailing":0.9,"pb_forward":0.8,"div_yield":3.89,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":3.71,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":31.8,"cash_to_assets":11.1,"current_ratio":2.58,"roe":5.7,"roa":2.8,"moat":{"ticker":"TX","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵行業本質上是商品化市場，品牌定價權極為有限。Ternium 的產品雖然有品質差異，但面對全球鋼鐵供應的波動，難以建立顯著的品牌溢價。客戶選擇供應商時，價格和交貨時間通常是主要考量因素，而非品牌忠誠度。因此，在品牌定價方面，Ternium 的護城河非常薄弱，難以抵禦市場的價格壓力。","comment_en":"The steel industry is inherently a commodity market with very limited brand pricing power. While Ternium's products may have quality differences, it struggles to establish significant brand premiums amidst global steel supply fluctuations. Customers primarily consider price and delivery times when choosing suppliers, rather than brand loyalty. Consequently, Ternium's moat in brand pricing is very weak, making it difficult to withstand market price pressures."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵生產的技術門檻相對較低，且許多核心技術已公開或廣泛應用。Ternium 並無顯著的專利壁壘，其競爭優勢更多來自於運營效率和規模。監管環境對鋼鐵行業有影響，例如貿易壁壘或環保法規，但這些並非 Ternium 獨有的專利或特許權，而是行業普遍面臨的挑戰，無法構成獨特的經濟護城河。","comment_en":"The technological barriers in steel production are relatively low, with many core technologies being public or widely adopted. Ternium does not possess significant patent barriers; its competitive advantages stem more from operational efficiency and scale. While regulatory environments impact the steel industry (e.g., trade barriers, environmental regulations), these are general industry challenges, not unique patents or licenses exclusive to Ternium, thus not forming a distinct economic moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於標準化鋼材產品，客戶轉換供應商的成本相對較低，主要涉及尋找新供應商和驗證其產品品質的過程。然而，對於特定應用或特殊規格的鋼材，若 Ternium 能提供定制化解決方案並建立穩定的供應關係，則可能產生一定的轉換成本。但整體而言，鋼鐵行業的轉換成本壁壘並不顯著。","comment_en":"For standardized steel products, the cost for customers to switch suppliers is relatively low, mainly involving the process of finding new suppliers and verifying product quality. However, for specific applications or special steel grades, if Ternium can offer customized solutions and establish stable supply relationships, some switching costs might arise. Overall, the switching cost barrier in the steel industry is not significant."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。產品的價值和使用不依賴於用戶數量或互動。Ternium 的業務模式不涉及平台或生態系統，其客戶關係主要基於產品供應和價格，而非網絡效應帶來的價值增長。因此，此維度幾乎沒有護城河可言。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the steel industry. The value and use of the product do not depend on the number of users or interactions. Ternium's business model does not involve platforms or ecosystems; its customer relationships are primarily based on product supply and price, not value growth derived from network effects. Therefore, there is almost no moat in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Ternium 作為全球領先的鋼鐵生產商之一，其規模經濟帶來了顯著的成本優勢。大型生產設施、集約化採購和物流網絡有助於降低單位生產成本。這種規模優勢使其在價格競爭中更具彈性，並能有效應對原材料價格波動。然而，鋼鐵行業的規模優勢並非絕對，仍需配合高效運營。","comment_en":"As one of the world's leading steel producers, Ternium benefits from significant cost advantages due to economies of scale. Large-scale production facilities, centralized procurement, and logistics networks help reduce per-unit production costs. This scale advantage provides greater flexibility in price competition and allows for effective responses to raw material price volatility. However, the scale advantage in the steel industry is not absolute and still requires efficient operations."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Ternium 在拉丁美洲市場擁有強大的地理優勢和穩固的市場地位，特別是在墨西哥和南錐體國家。其區域性的生產基地和分銷網絡使其能夠更好地服務當地客戶，並在特定區域市場獲得相對穩定的份額。這種地理上的集中佈局構成了一定的壁壘，尤其是在面對國際競爭時。","comment_en":"Ternium possesses strong geographical advantages and a solid market position in Latin America, particularly in Mexico and the Southern Cone countries. Its regional production bases and distribution networks enable it to better serve local customers and secure relatively stable market share in specific regional markets. This geographically concentrated layout forms a certain barrier, especially when facing international competition."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Ternium 在鋼鐵生產和供應鏈管理方面展現出較高的運營效率。通過持續的技術升級和流程優化，公司能夠在保證產品質量的同時，控制生產成本。其較高的 ROA (2.8%) 和 F-Score (5/9) 顯示了其在營運上的穩健性。高效的運營是其在商品化市場中維持競爭力的關鍵。","comment_en":"Ternium demonstrates high operational efficiency in steel production and supply chain management. Through continuous technological upgrades and process optimization, the company can control production costs while ensuring product quality. Its relatively high ROA (2.8%) and F-Score (5/9) indicate operational robustness. Efficient operations are key to maintaining competitiveness in a commoditized market."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Ternium 的資本配置策略似乎較為謹慎，注重維持健康的資產負債表（現金 $2,731.4M / 負債 $3,003.9M）和股東回報。雖然 ROE (5.7%) 處於相對較低的水平，但公司能夠產生穩定的自由現金流 (FCF TTM: $422.3M)，並用於股息支付和潛在的股票回購。其資本配置的穩健性優於激進擴張，但成長潛力受限。","comment_en":"Ternium's capital allocation strategy appears cautious, focusing on maintaining a healthy balance sheet (Cash $2,731.4M / Debt $3,003.9M) and shareholder returns. While ROE (5.7%) is relatively low, the company generates stable free cash flow (FCF TTM: $422.3M), used for dividends and potential share buybacks. Its capital allocation is sound rather than aggressive, but growth potential may be limited."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Ternium 通過提供穩定的產品質量、可靠的交付和區域性的服務網絡，能夠維持一定的客戶忠誠度。對於長期合作的客戶，尤其是在特定應用領域，轉換成本會有所增加。然而，在鋼鐵行業的價格波動和激烈競爭下，客戶的忠誠度並非牢不可破，仍需持續努力維護。","comment_en":"Ternium maintains a degree of customer loyalty by providing consistent product quality, reliable delivery, and a regional service network. For long-term partners, especially in specific application areas, switching costs increase. However, given the price volatility and intense competition in the steel industry, customer loyalty is not unbreakable and requires continuous effort to maintain."},"m10_durability":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵行業的週期性強，易受宏觀經濟波動影響，這限制了其業務的長期穩定性和可預測性。Ternium 的盈利能力會隨著鋼鐵價格的週期而大幅波動。雖然公司在區域市場有一定優勢，但其核心業務的基礎屬性使其難以擺脫行業週期的影響，長期來看，其業務的持久性面臨挑戰。","comment_en":"The steel industry is highly cyclical and susceptible to macroeconomic fluctuations, limiting the long-term stability and predictability of its business. Ternium's profitability fluctuates significantly with the steel price cycle. While the company has certain regional advantages, the fundamental nature of its core business makes it difficult to escape industry cycles, posing challenges to its long-term durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Ternium S.A. 在鋼鐵這個高度商品化的行業中運營，其經濟護城河相對較為薄弱。公司在規模成本和區域市場佔據上風（M5, M6），並展現出良好的運營效率（M7），這使其能在競爭激烈的市場中維持一定的生存能力。然而，品牌定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）幾乎不存在，轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）也相當有限。客戶忠誠度（M9）和業務的長期持久性（M10）受到行業週期的顯著影響。儘管管理層在資本配置上（M8）保持穩健，但整體而言，Ternium 的護城河更接近於一個週期性的商品生產商，而非具有持久特許經營權或顯著收費橋模式的企業。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Ternium S.A. operates in the highly commoditized steel industry, possessing relatively weak economic moats. The company holds advantages in scale costs and regional market presence (M5, M6), coupled with good operational efficiency (M7), enabling it to maintain a degree of viability in a competitive landscape. However, brand pricing power (M1) and patent barriers (M2) are virtually non-existent, while switching costs (M3) and network effects (M4) are limited. Customer retention (M9) and business durability (M10) are significantly impacted by industry cycles. Although management allocates capital prudently (M8), Ternium's moat is more akin to a cyclical commodity producer than a business with a durable franchise or a toll-bridge-like model.","evidenceHash":"569a33daf732473ce22b659dec7b1bd73d31a9ec161e1d0847e7ef1f030fc208","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"c465e2252ec5e837c92775e18dcdcd3d47dfa6c7b4623e29f886e66424cc4643"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"c465e2252ec5e837c92775e18dcdcd3d47dfa6c7b4623e29f886e66424cc4643"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TX.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TX.png","website":"https://www.ternium.com","ceo":"Maximo Vedoya","full_time_employees":"33253","description":"Ternium S.A. is an international steel enterprise engaged in the production, processing, and sale of a wide range of steel products. Its extensive market presence covers Mexico, Argentina, Brazil, the United States, and numerous other countries across Central and South America, including Paraguay, Chile, Bolivia, Uruguay, Colombia, Guatemala, Costa Rica, Honduras, El Salvador, and Nicaragua. The company operates through two primary divisions. Its Steel segment provides an exhaustive catalog of steel goods, from foundational products like slabs, billets, and hot-rolled flat items, to finished goods such as reinforcing bars, beams, tubes, and specialized building components like insulated panels, roofing, and pre-engineered metal systems. This segment also supplies pig iron and energy. The Mining segment concentrates on selling essential raw materials, specifically iron ore and pellets. In addition to its core manufacturing and mining activities, Ternium delivers medical, social, and engineering services, manages scrap, and acts as a significant distribution company. Its offerings cater to both large corporations and smaller enterprises across diverse sectors, including construction, automotive, home appliances, agriculture, packaging, transport, and energy. Founded in 1961 and based in Luxembourg City, Luxembourg, Ternium S.A. is a subsidiary of Techint Holdings S.à r.l.","description_en":"Ternium S.A. is an international steel enterprise engaged in the production, processing, and sale of a wide range of steel products. Its extensive market presence covers Mexico, Argentina, Brazil, the United States, and numerous other countries across Central and South America, including Paraguay, Chile, Bolivia, Uruguay, Colombia, Guatemala, Costa Rica, Honduras, El Salvador, and Nicaragua. The company operates through two primary divisions. Its Steel segment provides an exhaustive catalog of steel goods, from foundational products like slabs, billets, and hot-rolled flat items, to finished goods such as reinforcing bars, beams, tubes, and specialized building components like insulated panels, roofing, and pre-engineered metal systems. This segment also supplies pig iron and energy. The Mining segment concentrates on selling essential raw materials, specifically iron ore and pellets. In addition to its core manufacturing and mining activities, Ternium delivers medical, social, and engineering services, manages scrap, and acts as a significant distribution company. Its offerings cater to both large corporations and smaller enterprises across diverse sectors, including construction, automotive, home appliances, agriculture, packaging, transport, and energy. Founded in 1961 and based in Luxembourg City, Luxembourg, Ternium S.A. is a subsidiary of Techint Holdings S.à r.l.","description_zh":"**Ternium S.A. (TX) 業務營運概述**\n\nTernium S.A. 是一家國際鋼鐵企業，專注於鋼鐵產品的生產、加工與銷售。公司營運版圖遍及墨西哥、阿根廷、巴西、美國，以及巴拉圭、智利、玻利維亞、烏拉圭、哥倫比亞、瓜地馬拉、哥斯大黎加、宏都拉斯、薩爾瓦多與尼加拉瓜等中南美洲多國。\n\n公司主要劃分為兩大業務板塊：\n\n1.  **鋼鐵事業 (Steel Segment)**：提供全方位的鋼鐵產品，涵蓋從基礎原料如鋼胚 (slabs)、鋼錠 (billets) 及熱軋鋼捲 (hot-rolled flat items)，到成品如鋼筋、鋼樑、鋼管，以及用於建築的專業組件，例如：複合式隔熱板、屋頂材料與預鑄金屬結構系統。此板塊亦供應生鐵及能源。\n2.  **礦業事業 (Mining Segment)**：主要銷售關鍵礦產原料，包括鐵礦石 (iron ore) 與鐵礦球團 (pellets)。\n\n除核心的製造與採礦業務外，Ternium 並提供醫療、社會及工程服務，同時管理廢鋼業務，並扮演重要的經銷商角色。其產品與服務廣泛應用於建築、汽車、家電、農業、包裝、運輸及能源等多元產業，服務對象涵蓋大型企業與中小型企業。","address":"26 Boulevard Royal","city":"Luxembourg City","state":"LU","zip":"2449","country":"LU","phone":"352 26 68 31 52","full_address":"26 Boulevard Royal, Luxembourg City, LU 2449, LU","range_52w":"33.01-60.21","year_high":60.21,"year_low":33.01,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":33.01,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-03-17","name":"Montero Martinez Oscar","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-17","name":"Lozano Santiago","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-17","name":"Bassi Pablo Hernan","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-17","name":"Jimenez Flores Cesar Alejandro","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-17","name":"Baieli Carlos Alberto","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-13","name":"Catallini Renato","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-10","name":"Duelo Van Deusen Fernando","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-10","name":"Martinez Trigueros Lorenza","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-10","name":"Vedoya Maximo","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-06","name":"Decalf Vincent Robert Gilles","